{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/extras/DESC_1.gif?t=1744459273\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desktop Pals is the ultimate desktop companion game. Not only does the game have a large number of available pals to chose from, it also has a number of advanced features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/extras/DESC_2.gif?t=1744459273\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not only are the pals interactive with natural behaviour patterns, you can also overlay them over your favorite games, so you always have cute company!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game also features advanced customization. You can choose the pals location on your screen, his scale, his capabilities, and more! You can change the game to your liking.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592310?t=1744459273","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592310?t=1744459273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/696fe3eac78ce7d7821aa98579c4bf574a87e3fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744459273","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/696fe3eac78ce7d7821aa98579c4bf574a87e3fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744459273","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/extras/DESC_1.gif?t=1744459273\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desktop Pals is the ultimate desktop companion game. Not only does the game have a large number of available pals to chose from, it also has a number of advanced features.</p><p class=\"bb_para